  "reasoning": "The facts describe three distinct criminal behaviors: (1) the defendant accepted large sums of money, cash, shopping cards, and gold in exchange for using his official position, which constitutes bribery (受贿). (2) He diverted public funds from a state-owned enterprise to a private individual without proper authorization, which is embezzlement of public funds (挪用公款). (3) His personal assets far exceed his lawful income and a substantial portion cannot be explained, fitting the offense of a public official receiving unexplained huge assets (收受巨额财产来源不明). Therefore, three charges apply.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿;挪用公款;收受巨额财产来源不明<eoa>"
